[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Conversation" format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://game/talk/conversation.gd" id="1_convo"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_convo")
id = &"n5_simon"
text = "# DRAFT
# Brother Simon at dusk, at the back of the nave (night 5, clear and cold). Only if the porter saved him (n5_saved=simon).
# Shaking and grateful. He says little more than he told the porter in the chapter house: Thomas sent him to scrub the blood
# (the thomas_sent_simon note). He asks the porter not to tell anyone. Where he scrubbed: a flag that rocked (the hidden body).
# Claims: n5_simon_sent (true): Brother Thomas sent him to scrub the blood.
== start
(Brother Simon sits at the back of the nave, knees drawn up, a strip of linen at his neck where the knife touched him.)
(He flinches at your step, then sees who it is.)
Simon {afraid, look down}: Porter. Alric. I've not thanked you. I can't stop shaking long enough to thank you.
Simon {pleading}: What I told you in the chapter house. Keep it. Please. Don't tell anyone I said it.
-> topics

== again
(Simon hasn't moved. He's watching the door.)
Simon {sad}: You came back. Nobody else has.
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n5_simon_sent] Who sent you to scrub the blood, brother? -> sent
* [if simon_blood] [if not n5_simon_flags] What were you really scrubbing, brother? -> flags
* [if not n5_simon_promise] I'll keep it to myself, brother. I promise. -> promise

== sent [set n5_simon_sent] [note thomas_sent_simon]
Simon {afraid}: I told you. Don't make me say it again.
(He looks past you at the door, and whispers it.)
-> n5_simon_sent

# Thomas sent him to scrub the blood (design doc, cast table): true.
== n5_simon_sent [claim n5_simon_sent true]
Simon {afraid, look down}: Brother Thomas. He said it was for the good of the house. He said the abbot mustn't see it.
* [believe] I believe you, brother. -> sent_believed
* [press] Brother Thomas? He's been nothing but kind to me. -> sent_pressed

== sent_believed
Simon {ashamed}: He was kind about it. He's always kind.
Simon {sad}: You believe me. I'd not have said it to another soul in this house.
-> topics

== sent_pressed
Simon {ashamed}: He was kind about it. He's always kind.
Simon {ashamed, look down}: You see? Nobody will believe it of him. Forget I said it.
-> topics

== flags [set n5_simon_flags]
Simon {ashamed, look down}: Not wine. You knew it wasn't. It came up pink in the bucket, and then it wouldn't come up at all.
Simon {afraid, swallow}: There was a flag that rocked when I knelt on it. I didn't lift it. I didn't want to know.
-> topics

== promise [set n5_simon_promise] [trust simon 5]
(He lets out a breath, and some of the shaking goes out with it.)
Simon {ashamed}: Thank you. I'll not go back to the dormitory. I'll sleep here, where the candles are.
-> topics

== leave
Simon {pleading}: Don't tell anyone. Please.
"
